RTS AI website and Faction Studio

EA has not endorsed and does not support this product.

Command & Conquer, Red Alert and Yuri's Revenge art shown on rtsai.net (the Faction Studio's original countries and
the browser game's original-country mode) is used under EA's Command & Conquer Franchise Modding Guidelines
(Revision 2, 2025): free of charge and non-commercial, never sold or used to advertise goods or services, with no
music files from any C&C game. Those assets remain the property of Electronic Arts. The licence EA grants is
revocable; on request the art is removed.

The Faction Studio's mod library shows art from other OpenRA mods (Romanov's Vengeance, Combined Arms, Cameo,
Generals Alpha, RA+, Shattered Paradise, OpenHV, OpenRA Red Alert 2). That art belongs to each mod's authors and keeps
its own licence; each unit credits its mod and links the project. It is shown free of charge and non-commercially.

RTS AI's own code and art keep the licences stated in their repositories.
